spoon]] [[Cookbook:Chile Flakes|chile flakes]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* 2 teaspoons [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:olive oil|olive oil]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Liter|liters]] (8½ cups) water\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n* 100 grams (3.5 ounces) soaked [[Cookbook:chickpea|chickpea]]s (optional)\n\n==Procedure==\n# Mix all the ingredients together in a pot large enough to contain everything.\n# Place the pot over low heat. Cook for 90 minutes, stirring often.\n# Serve with lemon\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parsley]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile flake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Algerian recipes]]\n[[Category:Tunisian recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chorba Frik (Freekeh Soup)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"300 grams (⅔ pound) ground beef","sourceText":"300 grams (⅔ pound) ground beef","amountText":"300 grams (⅔ pound) ground beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"200 grams (7 ounces) crushed green wheat","sourceText":"200 grams (7 ounces) crushed green wheat","amountText":"200 grams (7 ounces) crushed green wheat","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped celery","sourceText":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped celery","amountText":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped celery","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped parsley","sourceText":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped parsley","amountText":"100 grams (3.5 ounces) chopped parsley","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tablespoon tomato